    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed Grid leads you through numerous <strong>hand-crafted puzzles</strong>, thoroughly exploring <strong>innovative twists</strong> of familiar mechanics. Each level presents <strong>unique challenges</strong> and subverts expectations. Every puzzle is a test of your <strong>planing</strong> and <strong>precision</strong> <strong>skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/9de2ee3b52e341562b5e0ca0222035be.poster.avif?t=1754121647\" width=308 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/9de2ee3b52e341562b5e0ca0222035be.webm?t=1754121647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/9de2ee3b52e341562b5e0ca0222035be.mp4?t=1754121647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/137d363295e36a531de44da95152f50d.poster.avif?t=1754121647\" width=308 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/137d363295e36a531de44da95152f50d.webm?t=1754121647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/137d363295e36a531de44da95152f50d.mp4?t=1754121647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calculate every move in advance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The malware you control must frequently charge from the power supply of the corporate servers you're hacking, requiring <strong>careful planning</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the most efficient solution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your malware will trip the servers' firewall protection if you stay for too long, asking you to find <strong>the optimal solution to each puzzle</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try the speedrunning mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for <strong>both speed and efficiency</strong> in Greed Grid's speedrunning ironman mode. You will get a timer on all levels and a score at the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dystopian world, not too far out in the future, and not too far away from our contemporary reality, the world's leading high-tech manufacturer is set to release a revolutionary new product. One unexpected death, however,  shines light on the company's <strong>insatiable greed</strong> and <strong>malevolent practices</strong>. Our protagonists will reach their breaking point and attempt to <strong>resist</strong> their omnipresent overlord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed Grid is a cautionary tale of the dangers of oligarchy, but also of the strength and power each of us possess to fight back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tens of unique, hand-crafted puzzles demanding careful planning and precise execution;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three levels of difficulty, each fundamentally changing how the game is played;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A speedrunning ironman mode, complete with a built-in timer and a scoring system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and characters based on real-life experiences and events;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard or\u00a0gamepad,\u00a0no\u00a0mouse\u00a0required;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed Grid leads you through numerous <strong>hand-crafted puzzles</strong>, thoroughly exploring <strong>innovative twists</strong> of familiar mechanics. Each level presents <strong>unique challenges</strong> and subverts expectations. Every puzzle is a test of your <strong>planing</strong> and <strong>precision</strong> <strong>skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/9de2ee3b52e341562b5e0ca0222035be.poster.avif?t=1754121647\" width=308 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/9de2ee3b52e341562b5e0ca0222035be.webm?t=1754121647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/9de2ee3b52e341562b5e0ca0222035be.mp4?t=1754121647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/137d363295e36a531de44da95152f50d.poster.avif?t=1754121647\" width=308 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/137d363295e36a531de44da95152f50d.webm?t=1754121647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574290/extras/137d363295e36a531de44da95152f50d.mp4?t=1754121647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calculate every move in advance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The malware you control must frequently charge from the power supply of the corporate servers you're hacking, requiring <strong>careful planning</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the most efficient solution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your malware will trip the servers' firewall protection if you stay for too long, asking you to find <strong>the optimal solution to each puzzle</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try the speedrunning mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for <strong>both speed and efficiency</strong> in Greed Grid's speedrunning ironman mode. You will get a timer on all levels and a score at the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dystopian world, not too far out in the future, and not too far away from our contemporary reality, the world's leading high-tech manufacturer is set to release a revolutionary new product. One unexpected death, however,  shines light on the company's <strong>insatiable greed</strong> and <strong>malevolent practices</strong>. Our protagonists will reach their breaking point and attempt to <strong>resist</strong> their omnipresent overlord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed Grid is a cautionary tale of the dangers of oligarchy, but also of the strength and power each of us possess to fight back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tens of unique, hand-crafted puzzles demanding careful planning and precise execution;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three levels of difficulty, each fundamentally changing how the game is played;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A speedrunning ironman mode, complete with a built-in timer and a scoring system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and characters based on real-life experiences and events;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard or\u00a0gamepad,\u00a0no\u00a0mouse\u00a0required;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Puzzle your way out of complex challenges as you hack through the servers of a major corporation. Discover the story of real-life inspired characters, unwillingly involved in a struggle against oppression and exploitation. Maybe it really is time to eat the rich!",
